<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px2" title="In 4.3 Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ HyFedRAG: A Federated Retrieval-Augmented Generation Framework for Heterogeneous and Privacy-Sensitive Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of different data formats</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" title="In 4.3 Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ HyFedRAG: A Federated Retrieval-Augmented Generation Framework for Heterogeneous and Privacy-Sensitive Data" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of cache</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
